  "description": "R-SQL-1 SQL-EQ-03, SQL-KEY-01: When equal numbers arrive from different declared types through UNION ALL, which values group together, which representative value and VARIANT type is returned, and does reversing arm order change either? Pairs: Integer/Double/Currency, Currency/Decimal, Date/Double, BIGINT/Double, each in both arm orders. Runs on a fresh copy of r-sql-1-accdb-main opened read-only through ACE DAO; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, Fields Name/Type/Size/SourceTable/SourceField are read before the first row, then every row's Field values to EOF (each MoveNext captured), then Close and DBEngine.Errors.",
